title: The Party Apparatus
subtitle: Paid secretaries choose the delegates. Whoever places them controls the party.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: rf_party
view-if: rf_apparatus_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rf_apparatus_timer = 3

= The Party Apparatus

The party has a growing staff of paid organisers, appointed by the Zentrale.

- @place
- @train
- @elect

@place
title: Place secretaries loyal to the leadership in the districts.
subtitle: Strengthens the leadership, the <span class="f-[+ leader +]">[+ leader_name +]</span>. Irritates everyone else.
on-arrival: {!
Q.apparatus += 5;
Q.members -= 3;
Q[Q.leader + '_strength'] += 4;
for (var f of window.RF.factions) {
    if (f != Q.leader) { Q[f + '_dissent'] += 2; }
}
!}

Reliable people now run the district offices. Some old activists, passed over, leave in disgust.

@train
title: Send young cadres to the International's schools in Moscow.
subtitle: Pleases <span class="f-stalin">Thälmann</span> and Moscow. Costs 1 fund.
choose-if: funds >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The party cannot pay for the journey.
on-arrival: {!
Q.funds -= 1;
Q.apparatus += 3;
window.RF.obey(Q, 6);
!}

A group of young functionaries leaves for Moscow. They will come back knowing Moscow's ways and whom they owe.

@elect
title: Let the members elect their own district leaders.
subtitle: Pleases the <span class="f-ultra">Ultra-Left</span> and <span class="f-left">Left</span>. Weakens the apparatus.
on-arrival: {!
Q.apparatus -= 5;
window.RF.lean(Q, {ultra: 3, left: 2, stalin: -2});
Q.members += 4;
!}

The districts elect their own leaders, and many choose the loudest critics of the Zentrale. The members like being asked.
